  type_choices_err_empty.pcpp - break step of type_choices.pcpp:
  a choices type needs at least one value (PR0035)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_empty.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_empty.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
